<title>UK: Hitachi prices $200 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Hitachi prices $200 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HITACHI CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    10.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.424   PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.824    SPREAD	+28 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
